---
source: src/test/mod.rs
expression: help_text
---
A cargo plugin to set package and dependency versions across a whole workspace

Usage: cargo_verset [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  package     Set the version of the packages in a crate or workspace
  dependency  Set the version requirement of a dependency in a crate or workspace
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -v, --verbose
          Print debug output

  -q, --quiet
          Only print warnings and errors

  -h, --help
          Print help

  -V, --version
          Print version
